#
msgid ""
msgstr "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "Add Rule"
msgstr "Tambahkan Aturan"

msgid ""
"Add rules to define which profile and entity the user will receive based on "
"their email domain (Optional)."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan aturan untuk menentukan profil dan entitas mana yang akan diterima"
" pengguna berdasarkan domain email mereka (Opsional)."

msgid "Automatically create users on first login"
msgstr "Buat pengguna secara otomatis pada login pertama"

msgid "Configuration updated."
msgstr "Konfigurasi diperbarui."

msgid "Default Rule (Fallback)"
msgstr "Aturan Default (Fallback)"

msgid "Default entity (ELSE)"
msgstr "Entitas default (JIKA TIDAK)"

msgid "Default profile (ELSE)"
msgstr "Profil default (JIKA TIDAK)"

msgid "Domain (after @)"
msgstr "Domain (setelah @)"

msgid "Entity"
msgstr "Entitas"

msgid "Failed to create the user in GLPI."
msgstr "Gagal membuat pengguna di GLPI."

msgid "Google SSO"
msgstr "Google SSO"

msgid "Google SSO — Configuration"
msgstr "Google SSO — Konfigurasi"

msgid "Google authentication failed: %s"
msgstr "Autentikasi Google gagal: %s"

msgid "Google login cancelled: %s"
msgstr "Login Google dibatalkan: %s"

msgid "Google response without authorization code."
msgstr "Respons Google tanpa kode otorisasi."

msgid ""
"If the user email does not match any of the rules above, this profile and "
"entity will be used. Mandatory if automatic creation is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Jika email pengguna tidak cocok dengan salah satu aturan di atas, profil dan"
" entitas ini akan digunakan. Wajib jika pembuatan otomatis diaktifkan."

msgid "Invalid OAuth2 state. Try again from the login page."
msgstr "Status OAuth2 tidak valid. Coba lagi dari halaman login."

msgid "Leave blank to keep current secret (stored encrypted)."
msgstr ""
"Biarkan kosong untuk mempertahankan rahasia saat ini (disimpan terenkripsi)."

msgid "No GLPI user corresponds to this Google account."
msgstr "Tidak ada pengguna GLPI yang sesuai dengan akun Google ini."

msgid "Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr "Hanya akun dari domain %s yang diterima."

msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profil"

msgid "Profile and Entity Rules by Domain"
msgstr "Aturan Profil dan Entitas berdasarkan Domain"

msgid "Register this Redirect URI in Google Cloud Console:"
msgstr "Daftarkan URI Pengalihan ini di Google Cloud Console:"

msgid "Restrict to domain (optional)"
msgstr "Batasi ke domain (opsional)"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Simpan"

msgid "Select..."
msgstr "Pilih..."

msgid "Session not initialized: user has no enabled profile."
msgstr ""
"Sesi belum diinisialisasi: pengguna tidak memiliki profil yang diaktifkan."

msgid "Sign in with Google"
msgstr "Masuk dengan Google"

msgid "The Google account does not have a verified email."
msgstr "Akun Google tidak memiliki email yang diverifikasi."

msgid "This user is deactivated in GLPI."
msgstr "Pengguna ini dinonaktifkan di GLPI."

msgid "or"
msgstr "atau"

msgid ""
"Leave the option <strong>\"Remove domain of logins in form "
"login@domain\"</strong> as <strong>No</strong>. If enabled, users with the "
"same prefix in different providers (e.g., admin@gmail.com and "
"admin@institution.edu.br) will suffer account overlap."
msgstr ""
"Biarkan opsi <strong>\"Hapus domain login dalam formulir "
"login@domain\"</strong> sebagai <strong>Tidak</strong>. Jika diaktifkan, "
"pengguna dengan awalan yang sama di penyedia berbeda (misalnya, "
"admin@gmail.com dan admin@insstitution.edu.br) akan mengalami tumpang tindih"
" akun."

msgid ""
"Check the <strong>Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button</strong> option "
"below and click <strong>Save</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Centang opsi <strong>Aktifkan tombol \"Masuk dengan Google\"</strong> di "
"bawah dan klik <strong>Simpan</strong>."

msgid ""
"Change the <strong>Automatically add users from an external authentication "
"source</strong> field to <strong>Yes</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Ubah bidang <strong>Tambahkan pengguna secara otomatis dari sumber "
"autentikasi eksternal</strong> ke <strong>Ya</strong>."

msgid "Step 1: Google Cloud Preparation"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Persiapan Google Cloud"

msgid "Critical Warning:"
msgstr "Peringatan Kritis:"

msgid "How to enable Google SSO integration?"
msgstr "Bagaimana cara mengaktifkan integrasi Google SSO?"

msgid ""
"Google will generate a <strong>Client ID</strong> and a <strong>Client "
"Secret</strong>. Fill in the fields in this form with those keys."
msgstr ""
"Google akan membuat <strong>ID Klien</strong> dan <strong>Rahasia "
"Klien</strong>. Isi kolom di formulir ini dengan kunci tersebut."

msgid ""
"Access the <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Google Cloud Console</a> and create a new "
"<strong>Project</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Akses <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Google"
" Cloud Console</a> dan buat <strong>Proyek</strong> baru."

msgid "Redirect URI:"
msgstr "Pengalihan URI:"

msgid "Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button"
msgstr "Aktifkan tombol \"Masuk dengan Google\"."

msgid ""
"Then go to <strong>Credentials &gt; Create Credentials &gt; OAuth client "
"ID</strong>, choosing the <strong>Web application</strong> type."
msgstr ""
"Lalu buka <strong>Kredensial &gt; Buat Kredensial &gt; ID klien "
"OAuth</strong>, memilih jenis <strong>aplikasi Web</strong>."

msgid "Step 2: GLPI Authentication Preparation"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Persiapan Otentikasi GLPI"

msgid ""
"Go to <strong>APIs &amp; Services &gt; OAuth consent screen</strong> and "
"configure your app (add the scopes <code>email</code>, <code>profile</code>,"
" and <code>openid</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Buka <strong>API &amp; Layanan &gt; Layar izin OAuth</strong> dan "
"konfigurasikan aplikasi Anda (tambahkan cakupan <code>email</code>, "
"<code>profile</code>, dan <code>openid</code>)."

msgid "In GLPI, go to <strong>Setup &gt; Authentication &gt; Setup</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Di GLPI, buka <strong>Penyiapan &gt; Otentikasi &gt; Penyiapan</strong>."

msgid ""
"Under <strong>Authorized redirect URIs</strong>, copy and paste exactly the "
"return URL below:"
msgstr ""
"Di bawah <strong>URI pengalihan resmi</strong>, salin dan tempel persis URL "
"kembali di bawah:"

msgid ""
"Subdomains are also accepted. E.g.: \"company.com\" will allow "
"user@company.com and user@sub.company.com."
msgstr ""
"Subdomain juga diterima. Mis.: \"company.com\" akan mengizinkan "
"user@company.com dan user@sub.company.com."

msgid ""
"To test the account creation rules and discover which Profile/Entity will be"
" assigned to an email,"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menguji aturan pembuatan akun dan menemukan Profil/Entitas mana yang "
"akan ditetapkan ke email,"

msgid ""
"The plugin calls <code>Session::init()</code>. The GLPI core loads the "
"user\\'s profiles and starts the session. The user is redirected to the "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Plugin memanggil <code>Sesi::init()</code>. Inti GLPI memuat profil pengguna"
" dan memulai sesi. Pengguna diarahkan ke dasbor."

msgid "Error Creating Account"
msgstr "Kesalahan Membuat Akun"

msgid "No Profile Configured"
msgstr "Tidak Ada Profil yang Dikonfigurasi"

msgid "Database Search"
msgstr "Pencarian Basis Data"

msgid "Do you wish to proceed and create your account now?"
msgstr "Apakah Anda ingin melanjutkan dan membuat akun Anda sekarang?"

msgid "click here"
msgstr "klik disini"

msgid "Auto Creation Disabled"
msgstr "Pembuatan Otomatis Dinonaktifkan"

msgid "Rules Simulator"
msgstr "Simulator Aturan"

msgid ""
"The system would log into the existing account <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)."
" No new account would be created."
msgstr ""
"Sistem akan masuk ke akun yang ada <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d). Tidak ada "
"akun baru yang akan dibuat."

msgid "▶️ Simulate Login"
msgstr "▶️ Simulasikan Login"

msgid ""
"Extracted domain: <strong>@%s</strong>. Applied rule: <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Domain yang diekstraksi: <strong>@%s</strong>. Aturan yang diterapkan: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Configuration Read"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Baca"

msgid "User \"%s\" already exists. Login would be performed successfully."
msgstr "Pengguna \"%s\" sudah ada. Login akan berhasil dilakukan."

msgid ""
"The email domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" is not allowed. The plugin "
"restricts access to the domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" or its subdomains."
msgstr ""
"Domain email \"<strong>%s</strong>\" tidak diperbolehkan. Plugin membatasi "
"akses ke domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" atau subdomainnya."

msgid ""
"The plugin calls <code>User::add()</code> to create the user "
"\"<strong>%s</strong>\"."
msgstr ""
"Plugin memanggil <code>User::add()</code> untuk membuat pengguna "
"\"<strong>%s</strong>\"."

msgid "using the primary email:"
msgstr "menggunakan email utama:"

msgid "User::add() called"
msgstr "Pengguna::add() dipanggil"

msgid "Profile Determined by Plugin"
msgstr "Profil Ditentukan oleh Plugin"

msgid ""
"Profile: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Entity: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr ""
"Profil: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Entitas: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"

msgid ""
"The email domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" is allowed by the restriction rule."
msgstr ""
"Domain email \"<strong>%s</strong>\" diizinkan berdasarkan aturan "
"pembatasan."

msgid "Core Default Profile Assigned"
msgstr "Profil Default Inti Ditugaskan"

msgid "Verified email present: <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Email terverifikasi ada: <strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "The user \"%s\" DOES NOT exist and auto-creation is disabled."
msgstr "Pengguna \"%s\" TIDAK ada dan pembuatan otomatis dinonaktifkan."

msgid "Profile Correction by Plugin"
msgstr "Koreksi Profil berdasarkan Plugin"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ya"

msgid "To access the system via Google, a new account will be created for"
msgstr "Untuk mengakses sistem melalui Google, akun baru akan dibuat"

msgid "Rule Used"
msgstr "Aturan yang Digunakan"

msgid "Plugin googlesso step"
msgstr "Langkah plugin googlesso"

msgid "Simulator:"
msgstr "Simulator:"

msgid "Account Creation Required"
msgstr "Pembuatan Akun Diperlukan"

msgid "Domain Rule for \"%s\""
msgstr "Aturan Domain untuk \"%s\""

msgid ""
"This simulator faithfully reproduces the entire execution chain — from the "
"plugin logic to the internal GLPI Core behavior. Enter an email and see "
"step-by-step what would happen in a real login."
msgstr ""
"Simulator ini dengan setia mereproduksi seluruh rantai eksekusi — mulai dari"
" logika plugin hingga perilaku internal GLPI Core. Masukkan email dan lihat "
"langkah demi langkah apa yang akan terjadi pada login sebenarnya."

msgid "Back to configuration"
msgstr "Kembali ke konfigurasi"

msgid "Account Creation Confirmation"
msgstr "Konfirmasi Pembuatan Akun"

msgid "Domain Rules"
msgstr "Aturan Domain"

msgid "Account Creation Simulator"
msgstr "Simulator Pembuatan Akun"

msgid "No"
msgstr "TIDAK"

msgid "No user found with the email <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Tidak ditemukan pengguna dengan email <strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Login / Email"
msgstr "Masuk / Email"

msgid ""
"The \"Automatically create users\" configuration is "
"<strong>DISABLED</strong>. The login would be blocked."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi \"Buat pengguna secara otomatis\" "
"<strong>DInonaktifkan</strong>. Login akan diblokir."

msgid "(none)"
msgstr "(tidak ada)"

msgid "Login blocked: Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr "Login diblokir: Hanya akun dari domain %s yang diterima."

msgid "The user \"%s\" would be created successfully."
msgstr "Pengguna \"%s\" akan berhasil dibuat."

msgid ""
"The plugin removes the incorrect profiles assigned by GLPI and explicitly "
"links the profile <strong>%s</strong> and entity <strong>%s</strong> using "
"the <code>Profile_User</code> class."
msgstr ""
"Plugin ini menghapus profil yang salah yang ditetapkan oleh GLPI dan secara "
"eksplisit menghubungkan profil <strong>%s</strong> dan entitas "
"<strong>%s</strong> menggunakan kelas <code>Profile_User</code>."

msgid "Email Validation"
msgstr "Validasi Email"

msgid "User found by email: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr "Pengguna ditemukan melalui email: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"

msgid "Domain Restriction Check"
msgstr "Pemeriksaan Pembatasan Domain"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Tidak ada"

msgid "Session::init() — Login Performed"
msgstr "Sesi::init() — Login Dilakukan"

msgid "Execution Chain (Step-by-Step)"
msgstr "Rantai Eksekusi (Langkah demi Langkah)"

msgid "Login to Existing Account"
msgstr "Masuk ke Akun yang Ada"

msgid "How it works:"
msgstr "Cara kerjanya:"

msgid ""
"In GLPI 11, the core ignores the profile passed by external authentications "
"and automatically assigns the global default profile (usually Self-Service) "
"to the new user."
msgstr ""
"Di GLPI 11, inti mengabaikan profil yang diteruskan oleh otentikasi "
"eksternal dan secara otomatis menetapkan profil default global (biasanya "
"Layanan Mandiri) ke pengguna baru."

msgid "Final Entity"
msgstr "Entitas Akhir"

msgid "Final Result"
msgstr "Hasil Akhir"

msgid "Back to Login"
msgstr "Kembali ke Masuk"

msgid "Simulated Email:"
msgstr "Email Simulasi:"

msgid ""
"Restrict domain: <strong>%s</strong> | Auto create users: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Batasi domain: <strong>%s</strong> | Buat pengguna secara otomatis: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Final Profile"
msgstr "Profil Akhir"

msgid ""
"The user \"%s\" would be created, but without ANY profile. Access to GLPI "
"would be denied. Please configure a valid profile in the Default Rule or "
"Domain Rules."
msgstr ""
"Pengguna \"%s\" akan dibuat, tetapi tanpa profil APAPUN. Akses ke GLPI akan "
"ditolak. Harap konfigurasikan profil yang valid di Aturan Default atau "
"Aturan Domain."

msgid "GLPI Core step"
msgstr "Langkah Inti GLPI"

msgid ""
"No valid profile (ID > 0) was found in the plugin rules. The user would be "
"created WITHOUT a profile."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada profil valid (ID > 0) yang ditemukan dalam aturan plugin. Pengguna"
" akan dibuat TANPA profil."
